Numbers whose distinct prime indices are not maximally refined.

The 63 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A384321

/-- Known terms of `A384321`, starting at index `1`. -/
def data : List retType :=
  [5, 7, 11, 13, 17, 19, 21, 22, 23, 25,
    26, 29, 31, 33, 34, 35, 37, 38, 39, 41,
    43, 46, 47, 49, 51, 53, 55, 57, 58, 59,
